  "2026-10-28T19:36:02.701Z",codex-agent,"Cause class: workflow-input contract mismatch. The immutable workflow SHA is annotated 2026.10.23 while its explicit pm-github-version input remains 2026.10.16. Existing test/install-pm-github.test.ts dynamically compares them and will remain unchanged. Merge main, change only the input, and prove the existing regression fails with the old input in a disposable copy."
  "2026-10-28T19:38:41.450Z",codex-agent,"Focused command node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/install-pm-github.test.ts passed 5/5 through pm test. Behavioral revert proof in a disposable copy: reverting only pm-github-version to 2026.10.16 makes the existing SHA-release/input equality assertion fail with ERR_ASSERTION; restoring 2026.10.23 passes 1/1. The contract test and all thresholds remain unchanged."
